{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":13,"ref":"2-kings 1:13","book":"2-kings","lang":"tw","chapter":1,"translation":"Ɔsan somaa sarfoɔ a ɔdi adɔnum ne ne adɔnum a ɔto so mmiɛnsa. Sarfoɔ a ɔdi adɔnum a ɔto so mmiɛnsa no kɔɔ soro, baa hɔ, buu n'akotoku ase wɔ Elia anim, bɔɔ mpaeɛ kɔɔ ne so, kaa kyerɛɛ no sɛ: Onipa a ɔyɛ Eloohim dea, mesrɛ wo, ma me nkwa ne wo akɔmfɔ yi — adɔnum — nkwa nsom bo wɔ wo ani so.","tokens":[{"surface":"וישב","gloss":"Ɔsan"},{"surface":"וישלח","gloss":"somaa"},{"surface":"שר","gloss":"sarfoɔ"},{"surface":"חמשים","gloss":"adɔnum"},{"surface":"שלשים","gloss":"a ɔto so mmiɛnsa"},{"surface":"וחמשיו","gloss":"ne ne adɔnum"},{"surface":"ויעל","gloss":"kɔɔ soro"},{"surface":"ויבא","gloss":"baa hɔ"},{"surface":"שר","gloss":"sarfoɔ"},{"surface":"החמשים","gloss":"adɔnum"},{"surface":"השלישי","gloss":"a ɔto so mmiɛnsa"},{"surface":"ויכרע","gloss":"buu n'akotoku ase"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"wɔ"},{"surface":"ברכיו","gloss":"n'akotoku"},{"surface":"לנגד","gloss":"anim"},{"surface":"אליהו","gloss":"Elia"},{"surface":"ויתחנן","gloss":"bɔɔ mpaeɛ"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"kɔɔ ne so"},{"surface":"וידבר","gloss":"kaa"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"kyerɛɛ no"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"onipa"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"Eloohim dea"},{"surface":"תיקר","gloss":"nsom bo"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"mesrɛ wo"},{"surface":"נפשי","gloss":"me nkwa"},{"surface":"ונפש","gloss":"ne nkwa"},{"surface":"עבדיך","gloss":"wo akɔmfɔ"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"yi"},{"surface":"חמשים","gloss":"adɔnum"},{"surface":"בעיניך","gloss":"wɔ wo ani so"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-15T23:27:53.292900510Z","model":"glm-5.3"}